This fixture exercises phpc's deterministic placeholder
`mysqli_stmt_bind_result()` plus `mysqli_stmt_fetch()` path for active
buffered `mysqli_stmt` objects. System PHP requires a real initialized
MySQLi connection and mysqlnd statement result buffers; phpc only binds
direct variable names and copies the current deterministic seed-post row into
those variables. It does not implement true by-reference aliasing,
unbuffered statement fetching, bound-parameter execution, real mysqlnd cursor
behavior, host database state, PHP warning/error fidelity, or native database
lowering.
